{"id": "36726", "title": "侠女行大运之江湖行", "author": "猪神的黄昏", "category": "武侠修真", "count": 94, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/36/36726.htm", "intro": "她有一对传奇的父母（貌似武功天下第一的无聊人）\r\n　　度过了传奇的童年（明明很有钱却自以为是穷人）\r\n　　拜入传奇的师门（美貌二师兄阴险三师兄刁蛮小师妹应有尽有，再加“悬崖定律”修正版……）\r\n　　经历传奇的初恋（差点被初恋情人杀死……）\r\n　　结拜传奇性的义兄（江湖二公子之一，英俊多金只是本份，最重要的是，他是一位bl……）\r\n　　踏入传奇的江湖（遇到有收集癖的小乞丐，有暴力倾向的青楼名妓，和貌似身份不明的男主……）\r\n　　她，必将成为传奇。", "base": "files/article/html/36/36726", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部 拜师学艺", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "2836894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2836895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2836896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2836897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2836898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2836899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2836900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2836901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2836902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "2836903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "2836904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "2836905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "2836906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "2836907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "2836908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "2836909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部 初出茅庐", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "2836911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2836912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2836913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2836914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2836915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2836916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2836917.html", "available": false}, {"title"